'''Ashvini Desert''' (アシビニ砂漠, ''Ashibini Sabaku'', '''Ashvini Desert''')  is a [[Behemoth Culling]] map added in [[Version 11.5 Update|Version 11.5]] and unlocked after clearing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1. It can drop [[Catfruit|Behemoth Stones]] of any of the main colors except Yellow until stage 11, but is less consistent with Purple and Red Behemoth Stones compared to [[Hidden Forest of Gapra]] and even more inconsistent with Yellow Behemoth Stones compared to [[Jinfore Volcano]], making this map ideal for grinding Green and Blue Behemoth Stones. In terms of [[Ototo Corps|materials]], stages 1-4 can drop either Gold or Beast Bones. After clearing any stage in Ashvini Desert, the map will disappear until the next day.

