==Trivia==
*Like [[Hidden Forest of Gapra]] and [[Jinfore Volcano]], Ashvini Desert is named after a breed of cat, in this case the [[wikipedia:Abyssinian cat|Abyssinian]] (in Japanese, Ashvini is written as アシビニ and Abyssinian is <u>アビシニ</u>アン).

